<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for your interest in the College of Nursing &amp; Health Innovation at Arizona State University.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">We are proud to offer a Bachelor’s of Science in Health Care Coordination. Offered at both ASU’s Downtown Phoenix and West campuses, this degree program prepares graduates to collaborate with individuals, families and integrated multidisciplinary teams to meet complex health needs while navigating current and future trends in public policy that affect the delivery of health care. &nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Through this major, students gain knowledge and skills related to health care systems, community and public health, community resources, health education, and health advocacy. Additionally, students build a strong foundation in health science.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">You can view more information about Health Care Coordination including employment opportunities and a major map <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/majorinfo/ASU00/NUHCCOBS/undergrad/false">online</a>.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you are ready to join the Sun Devil community, <a href="https://students.asu.edu/apply">apply now</a> for admission.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you have additional questions or concerns, please respond to this email or call our office at 602-496-0937 and we will be happy to assist.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Recruitment and Admissions</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">College of Nursing and Health Innovation</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Phone: 602-496-0937</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Office Hours: Monday - </span>Friday<span style="font-size: 12pt;">, 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. &nbsp;</span></div><div><a href="mailto:asu.hcc@asu.edu">asu.hcc@asu.edu</a></div><div><a href="https://nursingandhealth.asu.edu/">nursingandhealth.asu.edu</a></div></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>